WEBVTT

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.660
Imperial?! Him?! At "that" company?!

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:16.410
I-Is it true, President?

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.830
Y-Yeah.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:22.250
He was fired for workplace violence.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:28.040
President? No, Minato...

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.700
What's this about workplace violence?

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:34.160
Hey, Minato! Answer me!

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.080
Everyone, get--

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:42.660
Minato!

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:58.160
Minato!

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.290
Look out! Over here!

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:10.580
What's with that maju?!

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.620
It's not normal, that's for sure!

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:14.750
Psychopath Management.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:16.700
Psychopath Management?

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:19.830
It's one of the worst status effects.

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:26.660
Your abilities get way powered up,
but your feelings and senses are numbed.

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:32.580
You lose sympathy for everything
and feel nothing at all in your heart.

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:36.790
It sounds more like a travesty
than an affliction.

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:43.080
However, it grants a certain charisma
to both lead and command.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:46.870
So, those corporate slaves we saw on the way...

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.330
Yeah. They're being forced to work by the boss.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.370
That's an egotistical maniac for you.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:55.750
Hmph! Sounds like a jerk to me!

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:57.870
It kinda reminds me of you.

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:01.910
Minato!

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.080
Yutoria! Look out!

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.290
Y-You're...!

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:15.540
Take care of Minato!

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:18.790
Okay! I'll heal him right up!

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:26.450
Is it true? He really was in Imperial?

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:32.040
Was there really workplace violence?

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:37.200
Tell me! What exactly happened?!

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:59.000
"Episode Twelve: Management Fad"

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:08.370
You're doing pretty good. For a newbie, that is.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:10.120
Thank you.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:14.950
Well, it's nice a two star
like you is actually trying.

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:18.040
It's thanks to my party doing their best.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:23.040
Don't be a goody-two-shoes.
You've gotta let 'em know who's boss.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:26.870
They're idiots. The whole lot of 'em.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.910
I'm back...

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.700
Looks like the dead weight came back, huh?

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.410
Sometimes you've just gotta tell 'em off.

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:41.200
No kirakuri again this time?

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:44.700
Seriously, how do you even live with yourself?

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:47.040
S-Sorry.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:52.040
Sorry ain't gonna cut it!
We're paying you! Do your damn job!

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:53.370
Here it comes.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:54.620
Not again...

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:58.790
C'mon! Don't even have an excuse?

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:03.500
Good grief! Why did HR hire
a miserable oaf like you?

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.500
S-Sorry.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:08.160
If you're actually sorry, then quit.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:12.620
At this rate, you're just tarnishing
the Imperial name, you know?

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:17.040
Say something, boy! Your boss is talking to you!

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.660
Please, stop!

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:20.660
Huh? Say what?

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.080
You're taking it way too far.

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:26.580
I'm teaching you how to set workers straight.

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.250
In fact, you should be grateful.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:32.120
Go on. Let's hear you thank me.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.750
I'd rather not.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.700
Go on. Just say it.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.000
I won't!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:41.750
Say it! I'm the boss!
You think you can defy me?!

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:45.500
Even if you are the boss, what's wrong is wrong!

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:51.330
And then, he ended up hitting him.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:57.080
That incident must be why he got fired.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:01.540
Do you think he doesn't fight
in battles because of that?

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:05.580
Maybe he refuses to fight
so it won't happen again.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:08.250
Hey! What are you guys saying?!

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:10.540
Be quiet and keep that thing busy!

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:14.700
Just who do you think I am?!

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:20.120
Just forget about Rivar.
To think something like that happened...

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:24.080
Of course he hit him! His boss deserved it!

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:27.040
Oh... I guess I wasn't clear.

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:29.120
Minato never struck him.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.870
Huh?

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:34.660
Even if you are the boss, what's wrong is wrong!

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:37.660
Shuddap! I've had it with you!

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:44.830
The boss broke his hand punching him.

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:47.910
He fired Minato to get revenge.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:51.000
But the boss was demoted soon after.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.580
F-For real?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.540
It sounds so pathetic.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.580
But much brave.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.950
Yeah. I'm kinda relieved.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:03.120
The president is... Minato is...

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:05.330
...always so kind.

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.950
President! Are you okay?

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:13.950
Y-Yeah. It hurts though.

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:16.540
The healing magic kicked in!

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:18.790
And what a relief that is!

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:21.160
We heard about the incident.

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:23.410
Sorry for misunderstanding.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:26.370
A-And I'm sorry for keeping quiet.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:28.620
I didn't want to sound uncool.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:32.370
So, uh, Subaru? Why are you here?

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:37.500
I'll explain later.
For now, let's do something about that.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.540
That's right! Do something!

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:44.580
Rivar's getting overrun. But that maju...

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:48.450
I imagine it mutated because of the Big Gate.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.290
It suffers from "Psychopath Management."

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:54.120
Psychopath Management...

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.620
We should probably work together.

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.700
Right... I await your orders.

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.000
You want me to command you?

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:03.580
Is that a problem?

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:06.080
Understood.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:09.910
Guys! Sorry I got knocked out!

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:11.700
Just follow my orders!

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:12.700
Okay!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.370
Leave it to me!

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:16.580
It's not the same without you!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.910
Mineko fights!

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:21.450
Don't forget to count me in.

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:23.330
It's all you, President!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.330
Right!

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:29.000
Rivar! Sorry to keep you waiting so long!

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.870
We're joining the fight!

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:34.290
A maju like this is nothing for me!

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.700
Shit! Hurry it up!

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:43.160
Psychopath management loves efficiency.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:49.160
It should prioritize attacking
the highest-ranked person, so...

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:53.200
Subaru! Get its attention from a safe distance!

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.870
Copy that.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.160
Akari and Rivar! Keep it busy up close!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.500
Got it!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.160
You betcha!

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:05.660
Mineko and Yutoria!
Give support and hit any openings!

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:06.870
Okay!

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:08.870
Sure thing, President!

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:12.370
Marika and Valmi! Stay close-ish and attack!

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:14.040
That's more like it!

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:16.410
Understood!

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:19.040
Makoto! Do healing and backup!

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.950
Will do, President!

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.870
I am Subaru! Come fight me!

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.290
I'm right here! Come help yourself!

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.000
Avenge the president!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.620
If only you saw me now, President!

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:35.160
I hope you're watching from above!

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.870
The president is alive, you know!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.660
Just shout if you need heals!

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:43.660
Guys! Don't overdo it!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:47.580
Akari, go right! Rivar, go left!

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.790
Marika, keep your distance!

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:53.450
Makoto, support Subaru! Yutoria, there!

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:56.870
Tsk! All these orders are annoying!

00:08:56.870 --> 00:09:00.620
It's too easy with the maju
after the Imperial girl.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:03.160
That's Minato for you!

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:06.950
You're finished!

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:10.700
Nice!

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.410
Yes! We did it!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.250
Huh?

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.750
Wh-What's going on?

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.250
What the--?

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:25.830
For dying, it sure sounds healthy.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.370
This is... not good.

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:36.370
Expendable...

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.500
They're being forced to obey.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.290
They're all corporate slaves...

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.950
So pitiful. So sad.

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:12.910
That's Psychopath Management for you.
It hurts to see such power abuse.

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:16.580
Even if he's their boss, this is too cruel!

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:19.370
Overtime... Overtime...

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:26.410
Hmph! I empathize with manual labor,
but there's too many of 'em.

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:28.330
Guys, I'll handle this!

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:32.870
Hey, hey! Can the weak little
president please stay... back?

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.660
President...

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:43.910
You guys are being worked too hard!
You shouldn't have to fight like this!

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.160
Restructuring...

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.040
I know! Restructuring can be scary!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:53.750
But workers and employers
are supposed to be equal!

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.290
Don't stand for unfair dismissal!

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:02.580
It's true... Bosses give you work and orders.

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:08.540
But that's not to say they're better!
Only their role is different!

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:13.500
It's because our roles differ that
it's important to respect each other!

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:16.250
Of course, that's easier said than done.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:28.450
Even so, I strive to show compassion
to everyone I work with!

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.370
That's my vow as president!

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:35.580
Annual leave... Annual leave...

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:49.200
Hmph. Now that's pitiful.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:52.450
Hey! Hurry up and stamp it.

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:54.000
R-Right!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:08.790
I think I won't after all.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:11.790
We'll fight again when he's back to normal.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:18.040
Good grief. You're such a softy.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:20.580
But that's exactly how we like you.

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:25.870
Thanks. Having said that,
I haven't forgotten about the kirakuri.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.870
Let's go! It's gotta be close!

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:34.910
Whoa! Awesome!

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:36.830
More than Mineko thought!

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:38.620
It's so pretty!

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:44.540
And high purity too! With all this,
we'll meet our goal and then some!

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:47.330
Yeah! And it's thanks to everyone!

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:51.370
In any case, what was up with that maju?

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:54.540
I've never heard of
"Psychopath Management" before.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.160
It's the effects of the Big Gate.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:13:01.410
This dungeon itself was brought
about by the Big Gate.

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:04.750
We're calling them "black dungeons."

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:06.370
Black dungeons?

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:11.120
Yes. I'm investigating them on
behalf of the Adventure Agency.

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:14.580
That's the job of Imperial's "Special Unit 1."

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.080
Special Unit?

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.330
That sounds kinda cool.

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:22.410
Impressive, President!
You used to be in that company!

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:24.540
But I got fired...

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:28.370
In the end, you're just a two-star adventurer!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:32.790
Oh... That's going by the
Adventure Agency's rating.

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:37.790
According to our assessment
based on command and analysis...

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.580
...he's worthy of seven stars.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.160
Did you say seven?!

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:44.410
A-Are you serious?!

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:48.250
--If he hardly believes it, he can't be that reliable.
--Yippee! I gained some self-confidence!

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:53.370
There's no time to sit and chat.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:57.370
The Big Gate is distorting this entire area.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:59.750
The dungeon will soon collapse.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.580
Collapse? We better hurry!

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:04.200
I'll be on my way.

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:06.700
Uh, what about your kirakuri?

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:10.330
No thanks.
There's not enough time to gather any.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.500
We'll be taking our leave too!

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:17.500
I'd rather not become a pancake!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:23.200
Hmph! I'd normally take 90%,
but I'll settle for this today.

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.660
Rivar...!

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:27.580
Farewell, Kibou crew! Good day!

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.200
Adios!

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:31.500
That was generous of them.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:34.200
President! Let's not let 'em down!

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.330
Yeah. Let's not.

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.660
Guys! We're outta time!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.790
Grab whatever kirakuri you can and let's scram!

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.250
Right!

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.250
That's the best reply today...

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:53.700
Whoa! Incredible! What a sight to behold!

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.950
Is everyone ready?

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:56.910
Yeah!

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:59.910
Then it's time to summon the goddess!

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:01.120
Finally!

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.080
I wonder what she's like.

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:05.950
I'm so excited!

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:07.540
Unforgivable.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:11.450
I'm just curious, okay?
I've never seen one before!

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:17.080
There! I've done my part!

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.870
Huh? That's it?

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:20.410
Yes!

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:23.410
Th-That's Guide for you. Quick worker.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.870
Look! The kirakuri!

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:30.870
At long last!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.370
Are you the ones who have summoned me?

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:50.450
Y-Yes, we are!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:56.370
Very well. Now then, please state
the wish you would like me to grant.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:58.450
Yutoria, could you?

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:00.160
You want me to?

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:04.870
Yeah. Since it's because of you
that we met the goddess.

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:07.290
All right.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.200
We have a question!

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:13.200
Where is the old man,
Minato's father, right now?

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:20.370
Please tell us, goddess!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:24.160
I don't know.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:26.290
Huh?

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:31.370
Wh-What exactly do you mean by that?

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:33.290
Just like it sounds.

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:39.580
At the moment, all I can tell you
is that person doesn't exist in this world.

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:42.000
He doesn't exist in this world?

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:44.700
S-So he's among the stars?

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:47.500
No, he is not deceased.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:52.120
He's not in this world,
but the world within the Big Gate.

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:54.950
Um, could you be more specific?

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:59.040
I'm terribly sorry, but I know nothing more.

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:02.290
After all, I'm only a clerk!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:05.120
Huh? You're a clerk?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:10.410
Yes. Only a manager-class goddess
can answer your question.

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:12.700
A manager-class goddess?

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:15.410
To schedule an appointment with one,

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:20.200
you need to pay the base goddess
fee plus executive pay!

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:22.450
I-Is that right?

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:26.370
Even the goddess world has its problems.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:31.660
U-Um, can a clerk goddess
like you do anything else?

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:34.040
Well, I'm glad you asked!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:36.580
For details, please take a look at this!

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.750
Let's see...

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.290
Hmm?

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:49.700
"Recover From Any Fatigue:
The Goddess's Service Menu."

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:53.160
I can deliver the E through G-courses.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:58.500
Once you've decided, fill out the form
and apply through the mail!

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.580
Cheers!

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:09.580
Ugh! We totally did that for nothing!

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:14.540
I'm really sorry. I had no idea
it would turn out like that.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:17.410
No, it's not your fault, Guide!

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:21.330
I never imagined a goddess
wouldn't know something!

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.450
But we did get one answer.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:26.000
We know for sure my father's alive.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:33.870
Even now, I'm sure he's on some
crazy adventure beyond the Big Gate.

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:39.290
And well, about the future...

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:44.540
I'm thinking of investigating
the Big Gate while gathering kirakuri.

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:47.410
Hopefully with everyone's help, but...

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:50.950
What do you say?

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:52.950
Of course! Count me in!

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:55.250
I'd worry if it's just you!

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:57.450
Leave the healing to me!

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:59.910
Mineko goes with Makoto.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:03.120
I'll follow wherever you lead!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:07.660
As for me... You know without saying, right?

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.160
Thank you, everyone!

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:12.830
No, no! Thank you!

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:16.160
Great! Let's give our all tomorrow too!

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:17.830
I'll do my best!

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:19.540
Mineko too!

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:24.080
It's getting hot in here again!
Not that it's a bad thing...

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:28.080
Come on! Let's have a toast
and celebrate with the usual!

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:30.450
Guys, you ready?

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:32.040
Yeah!

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:35.370
Here goes! Kibou...

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:37.370
...Fight!

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:43.700
Psychopath Management?

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:47.080
Yes. I believe it was caused by the Big Gate.

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.870
The effects are spreading more than expected.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.080
At this rate, disaster is not far off.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:54.910
Unbelievable.

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:59.080
We still have time. How will you handle this?

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:04.410
I do have one idea--
to use Kibou Company.

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:09.000
Their president Minato
formerly worked for Imperial.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:15.410
Your high expectations of him are why
you've invested in Kibou, is it not?

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:17.080
Well, true...

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:20.370
Having said that, I foresee problems.

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:24.040
If it's him, do you believe he can handle it?

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:29.000
I don't know, but I think we can be optimistic.

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:32.000
Very well. Leave it to him.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.750
Thank you.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:36.120
Kibou Company...

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:41.660
Could they be our...
this world's last hope after all?

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:49.040
It's been nearly a year
since I joined this company.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:52.750
Even now, my days as president continue.

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:59.040
Of course, there're hardships and days
where things don't go my way, but...

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:00.040
President!

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:03.660
I knew you'd be here.

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:04.700
Yutoria...

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:17.000
Thank you, Yutoria.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:19.080
No, thank you.

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:26.750
Oh, by the way... Did you decide
your wish for the goddess?

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:30.870
Yeah. I was thinking of doing
the company outing.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:32.540
I like the sound of that!

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:33.540
Yeah!

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:48.250
Yeah, this is my love...

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:55.540
To me, this is... Kibou Company is...

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:57.950
...more special than anything.

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:40.910
Good morning, everyone!

00:23:40.910 --> 00:23:43.950
Let's do our best again today!
